#: ../../source/docs/esp32-autopilot.rst:5 f6b4a1833d8c4704bebbf863443e6f67
msgid "ESP32 Based Autopilot"
msgstr "基于 ESP32 的飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/esp32-autopilot.rst:7 3ea19d69fc7b4339b510daee74d6e6b0
msgid ""
"this code and development is experimental. No OEM has produced an ArduPilot "
"compatible autopilot based on the ESP32. This code requires that sensors be "
"attached to an ESP32 board or making a custom PCB. Only the 'classic' ESP32 "
"is currently targeted but work on ESP32S3 in in progress."
msgstr ""
"此代码和开发为实验性质。目前尚无 OEM 基于 ESP32 生产与 ArduPilot 兼容的飞控。使用此代码需要将传感器连接到 ESP32 "
"开发板或制作自定义 PCB。目前仅针对「经典」ESP32，ESP32S3 的支持工作正在进行中。"

#: ../../source/docs/esp32-autopilot.rst:9 8a3aeb6184d443fd9952d658cd44dbd6
msgid ""
"Monitor the `ArduPilot Discord ESP32 channel "
"<https://discord.com/channels/674039678562861068/777475957476032523>`__ for "
"updates and developments."
msgstr ""
"请关注 `ArduPilot Discord ESP32 频道 "
"<https://discord.com/channels/674039678562861068/777475957476032523>`__ "
"以获取最新进展。"

